[15] $\frac{x^2-3}{x+\sqrt{3}}=\frac{x^2-(\sqrt{3})^2}{x+\sqrt{3}}=\frac{(x+\sqrt{3})(x-\sqrt{3})}{x+\sqrt{3}}=x-\sqrt{3}$.
